@startuml U15_case_lifecycle_state
!include style.iuml
title U15 — Case lifecycle (state machine, final; update of 05, Migrating removed)

[*] --> New
New --> Running : start trigger\n/ CaseStarted, first tokens
New --> Failed : start inputs missing
Running --> Running : task replies, decisions, splits and joins,\nretries, escalations, answer timeouts
Running --> Completed : End fires and no token is left\n/ CaseCompleted (+ announced event)
Running --> Failed : task failed for good, no fallback, nothing to undo,\nor a decision cannot be evaluated\n/ CaseFailed, cancel tokens
Running --> Compensating : task failed for good, no fallback,\nfinished steps have undo actions (ENG-08)
Compensating --> Compensated : every undo level confirmed\n/ CaseCompensated
Compensating --> Failed : an undo reports ok = false\n/ manager alerted, CaseFailed
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Compensated --> [*]
note right of Completed
  I4: every case ends in exactly one final
  state; later messages are recorded and ignored.
  ("cancelled" exists as a final status in the model,
  but no action cancels a whole case yet.)
end note
@enduml
